  description: '"Majestic Dragon" + "Stardust Dragon" + 1 non-Tuner monster

    During
    either player''s turn, when your opponent activates a card or effect: You can
    Tribute this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy all cards your
    opponent controls. Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent
    controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn, and you can activate
    1 of its effects as this card''s effect once this turn. During the End Phase:
    Target 1 "Stardust Dragon" in your Graveyard; return this card from the field
    to the Extra Deck, then Special Summon that target.'
